DESCRIPTION:Sign up!\nA one-man show where songs become a live graphic novel telling the stories of ordinary people and what saves them.\nThat’s the idea behind Songs\, Stories\, & Art: Lessons from Strangers\, a visually rich and emotionally resonant live show from award-winning songwriter John John Brown. With only a guitar\, a projector\, and a storyteller’s heart\, Brown guides audiences through 14 character-driven portraits\, each one brought to life with original hand-drawn comics and narrative songs.\n\nLink: https://www.barnevents.info/events/2026/7/17/songs-stories-and-art-lessons-from-strangersa-visual-folk-concert-by-john-john-brown
DTEND:20260718T020000Z
LOCATION:The Barn
DTSTART:20260718T000000Z
SUMMARY:🎵 [Folk/Acoustic] Songs\, Stories\, and Art: Lessons from Strangers—A Visual Folk Concert by John John Brown
UID:9a676c9f-28e1-4a24-8216-32f845abe7f5@9a67.org
